{"hymn":"S491","parent":"E597","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Yo sé que vive el Redentor","subtitle":"Experiencia de Cristo—General","syl":{"n1":"Yo","n2":"sé","n3":"que","n5":["vi","i"],"n6":["ve‿el","t"],"n7":["Re","i"],"n9":["den","m"],"n10":["tor,","t"],"n11":"Por","n12":"mí","n14":["o","i"],"n16":["ran","m"],"n18":["do‿es","m"],"n19":["tá;","t"],"n20":["Su‿a","i"],"n21":["mor","t"],"n22":"Él","n24":"me","n25":["o","i"],"n26":["tor","m"],"n27":["ga","t"],"n28":"hoy,","n29":"Me","n30":"da","n31":"Su","n32":["li","i"],"n34":["ber","m"],"n35":["tad.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Yo sé que vive‿el Redentor,","Y vida eterna da;","Vivificante‿Espíritu,","Es gracia sin igual."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Él mi cabeza‿eleva hoy","Me trae salvación;","En Su presencia‿hay libertad,","Y muy pronto vendrá."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Anhela Él mi santidad,","¡Su gracia lo hará!","Pues Su divina voluntad,","Él siempre cumplirá."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["En Tu palabra firme‿estoy:","Por siempre creceré;","Por mí regresarás, Señor;","Contigo estaré."]}]}